## 4. Alternative Approaches (if the plugin doesn’t fit)

| Approach | When to use | Pros | Cons |
|----------|-------------|------|------|
| **`leaflet.vectorgrid` (L.VectorGrid.Protobuf)** | You want *pure* Leaflet rendering (no WebGL) and need to style vector tiles with Leaflet’s `L.Path` API. | Works on all browsers, easy to style with Leaflet functions. | Limited styling (no expressions, filters, 3-D). Slower for large datasets. |
| **Full MapLibre GL JS + Leaflet UI** | You only need a basemap and can forego Leaflet’s layer system. | Simpler, full GL styling power. | You lose Leaflet’s easy marker/heatmap APIs unless you re-implement them. |
